# Frontera container build context (PROD-03-03).
#
# Allow-list: everything is excluded unless named below, so a developer's
# .env, databases, backups, keys, node_modules, build output, worktrees and IDE
# files can never reach an image layer. tests/pilot-deployment-kit.structure.test.mjs
# and the deployment qualification inspect the built image to prove it.
*

# Sources the build compiles.
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!tsconfig.base.json
!tsconfig.src.json
!types/
!src/
!packages/
# npm ci needs every workspace's package.json (the lockfile lists them); the
# apps themselves are not built or shipped.
!apps/*/package.json
# The vendored @aoc/protocol tarball the lockfile pins (build-time dependency).
!vendor/*.tgz
!scripts/
# The frozen API surface the release identity records.
!release/api-surface.v1.json
!LICENSE
!NOTICE.md
!COPYRIGHT.md
!TRADEMARKS.md

# Never, even inside an allowed directory.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-test
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.data
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*.db
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/backups
**/*.aoc-enterprise-backup
**/.DS_Store
